@startuml
title Bonecutters Client App Shell
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "index.html" as IndexHtml
component "main.tsx" as Main
component "App.tsx" as App
component "styles.css" as Styles
component "HomePage" as HomePage
cloud "S3 Static Files" as S3
cloud "CloudFront" as CloudFront

IndexHtml --> Main : loads module
Main --> App : mounts React
Main --> Styles : imports global stylesheet
App --> HomePage : renders current public page
S3 --> IndexHtml : serves built HTML
CloudFront --> S3 : origin request

note right of App
The app shell stays intentionally narrow.
Page-owned content and documentation live under pages/.
Reusable component contracts live under components/.
end note

@enduml
